      "disambiguatingDescription": "中川マスター / Nakagawa Master is the published pen name of Keisuke Nakagawa. MasterJP is his author-confirmed byline on ZEROICHI at https://zeroichi.media/author/masterjp. This mapping identifies that publisher's byline; it is not a name match to unrelated MasterJP accounts. Original works: https://master.ricette.jp/. GitHub author account: https://github.com/Nakagawa-master.",
      "description": "Author of 313 interconnected original works; his public engineering findings and reviews have informed independently implemented changes in prominent open-source projects. Ten merged GitHub PRs in five receiving repositories have evidence links in this dataset."
    },
